      "id": 1,
      "text": "Before 1837, the land where Tomahawk is now situated belonged to the Ojibwe, who traded actively with various fur trading companies.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        30
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
