      ],
      "source": "https://tomahawkhistoricalsociety.org/"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Pickles the Drummer, the drummer for the virtual death metal band Dethklok and the series Metalocalypse, was raised in Tomahawk.",
